# Ignore Cargo.lock in general (monorepo-wide default),
# BUT track the Rust crate's lockfile for reproducible CI builds.
# The 2023 Rust guidance recommends committing lockfiles even for libraries.
Cargo.lock
!packages/rust/Cargo.lock

